#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hello World: Your First Quantum Circuit"
msgstr "Hello World : Votre premier circuit quantique"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"hello-world.ipynb\" description=\"This "
"tutorial was created for doQumentation.\" />\n"
msgstr ""
"<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"hello-world.ipynb\" description=\"Ce "
"tutoriel a été créé pour doQumentation.\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Build a [Bell state](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bell_state) (two "
"entangled qubits) and run it three ways:\n"
msgstr ""
"Construis un [état de Bell](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bell_state) (deux "
"qubits intriqués) et exécute-le de trois manières :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Ideal simulation** — perfect results, no account needed\n"
msgstr "**Simulation idéale** — résultats parfaits, aucun compte requis\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**Noisy simulation** — simulates a real device, no account needed\n"
msgstr ""
"**Simulation bruitée** — simule un véritable appareil, aucun compte requis\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Real quantum hardware** — requires a free IBM Quantum account (setup steps"
" below)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Matériel quantique réel** — nécessite un compte IBM Quantum gratuit "
"(étapes de configuration ci-dessous)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Build the circuit {#build-the-circuit}"
msgstr "Construire le circuit {#build-the-circuit}"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Option 1: Ideal simulation (no account needed) {#option-1-ideal-simulation-"
"no-account-needed}"
msgstr ""
"Option 1 : Simulation idéale (aucun compte requis) {#option-1-ideal-"
"simulation-no-account-needed}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Uses `StatevectorSampler` — a local simulator with perfect, noise-free "
"results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Utilise `StatevectorSampler` — un simulateur local avec des résultats "
"parfaits, sans bruit.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Option 2: Noisy simulation (no account needed) {#option-2-noisy-simulation-"
"no-account-needed}"
msgstr ""
"Option 2 : Simulation bruitée (aucun compte requis) {#option-2-noisy-"
"simulation-no-account-needed}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Uses `FakeManilaV2` — a local simulator that mimics a real IBM quantum "
"device, including its noise characteristics. The circuit must first be "
"transpiled (adapted) to the device's gate set and qubit connectivity.\n"
msgstr ""
"Utilise `FakeManilaV2` — un simulateur local qui reproduit le comportement "
"d'un véritable appareil quantique IBM, y compris ses caractéristiques de "
"bruit. Le circuit doit d'abord être transpilé (adapté) au jeu de portes et à"
" la connectivité des qubits de l'appareil.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Option 3: Real quantum hardware {#option-3-real-quantum-hardware}"
msgstr "Option 3 : Matériel quantique réel {#option-3-real-quantum-hardware}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Requires a free IBM Quantum account. To set one up:\n"
msgstr "Nécessite un compte IBM Quantum gratuit. Pour en créer un :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Register at "
"[quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration)"
" — no credit card required for the first 30 days\n"
msgstr ""
"Inscris-toi sur "
"[quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration)"
" — aucune carte de crédit requise pendant les 30 premiers jours\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Sign in at [quantum.cloud.ibm.com](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) and select"
" region **us-east** (required for the free Open Plan)\n"
msgstr ""
"Connecte-toi sur [quantum.cloud.ibm.com](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) et "
"sélectionne la région **us-east** (requise pour le forfait Open gratuit)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create an instance (free Open Plan) at "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) if you don't have one "
"yet\n"
msgstr ""
"Crée une instance (forfait Open gratuit) sur "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) si tu n'en as pas "
"encore\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create an API key at [quantum.cloud.ibm.com](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) "
"(or at [cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys))\n"
msgstr ""
"Crée une clé API sur [quantum.cloud.ibm.com](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) "
"(ou sur [cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys](https://cloud.ibm.com/iam/apikeys))\n"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Copy your **CRN** (Cloud Resource Name) from your "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) page\n"
msgstr ""
"Copie ton **CRN** (Cloud Resource Name) depuis ta page "
"[Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Then, if you haven't saved your credentials yet in this Binder session, run "
"the cell below. Replace `<your-api-key>` with the API key from step 4, and "
"`<your-crn>` with the CRN from step 5.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ensuite, si tu n'as pas encore enregistré tes identifiants dans cette "
"session Binder, exécute la cellule ci-dessous. Remplace `<your-api-key>` par"
" la clé API de l'étape 4, et `<your-crn>` par le CRN de l'étape 5.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Note:** Jobs on real hardware may take some time depending on queue times."
" If the cell is still running, you can check your job status and see the "
"results at "
"[quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads?user=me).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Remarque :** Les tâches sur du matériel réel peuvent prendre un certain "
"temps en fonction des délais d'attente. Si la cellule est toujours en cours "
"d'exécution, tu peux vérifier l'état de ta tâche et consulter les résultats "
"sur "
"[quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads?user=me).\n"

